    <!-- About Calmpal -->
    <h2>About Calmpal</h2>
    <p>Calmpal is a privacy-first, atmospheric nature sounds and sleep timer application for iOS. It is engineered to support focus, meditation, relaxation, and deep sleep through high-fidelity, seamlessly looped ambient soundscapes.</p>
    <p>Key features include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>21+ High-Definition Ambient Audio Tracks (Gentle Rain, Ocean Waves, Cozy Campfire, Crickets Night, Forest River, and more)</li>
      <li>Custom Fluid Sleep Timer with seamless background audio playback</li>
      <li>Distraction-Free Zen Mode for pure visual and auditory immersion</li>
      <li>100% On-Device, Offline-First Architecture with zero tracking or telemetry</li>
      <li>Full integration with Lock Screen media controls and AirPods hardware playback</li>
    </ul>

    <!-- Frequently Asked Questions -->
    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>How do I start or pause audio?</h3>
      <p>Tap anywhere on the screen or tap the center play button on the dock. You can also control playback directly from your Lock Screen, AirPods, or iOS Control Center.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>Does Calmpal support background playback?</h3>
      <p>Yes. Calmpal continues playing ambient soundscapes when you switch apps or lock your device.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>How do I adjust the sleep timer?</h3>
      <p>Tap the pencil icon on the bottom dock to enter Edit Mode. Drag the measuring lines up or down to set your desired countdown (from 1 minute up to 4 hours), then tap the checkmark to confirm.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>How do I switch soundscapes?</h3>
      <p>Tap the music note icon on the dock to open the full Sound Library, or use the left and right arrows to quickly skip between sounds.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>What is Zen Mode?</h3>
      <p>Tap the eye icon at the top of the screen to hide all buttons and timer rings for a completely clean, photographic backdrop.</p>
    </div>

