    <h2>Privacy Policy & Data Governance</h2>
    <p>Last Updated: August 19, 2026</p>
    <p>Calmpal is built with a <strong>privacy-first, on-device architecture</strong>. We do not track you, sell your data, or transmit your session history.</p>

    <h3>1. Zero Data Selling Guarantee</h3>
    <p>We <strong>NEVER</strong> sell, rent, monetize, or trade your personal information, listening history, or session data to data brokers, advertisers, or third parties under CCPA/CPRA § 1798.120 and GDPR Article 21.</p>

    <h3>2. Minimal On-Device Processing</h3>
    <p>Calmpal processes only minimal, strictly essential technical preferences stored locally on your device:</p>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Data Category</th>
          <th>Purpose</th>
          <th>Storage Location</th>
          <th>Retention</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Sound & Timer Preferences</strong></td>
          <td>Persists active sound choice and custom duration between sessions.</td>
          <td>Local Device Storage (UserDefaults)</td>
          <td>Until cleared by user.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Diagnostic Crash Logs</strong> (Optional)</td>
          <td>Identifies audio engine runtime faults to maintain stability.</td>
          <td>Anonymized (Apple App Store)</td>
          <td>30 days rolling.</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h3>3. Zero Remote AI Model Training</h3>
    <p>Your listening sessions, timer countdowns, and preferences are <strong>never transmitted to or used to train external AI models</strong>. All audio synthesis and timer logic execute 100% locally on your iPhone.</p>

    <h3>4. Third-Party Service Processors</h3>
    <p>We work exclusively with certified infrastructure providers:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Apple Inc. (App Store):</strong> Native iOS app binary distribution and localized crash reporting (ISO 27001 / GDPR compliant).</li>
      <li><strong>Google LLC (Fonts):</strong> Typography delivery (EU-US DPF / ISO 27001 compliant).</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>5. One-Click Local Data Erasure</h3>
    <p>Under GDPR Article 17 and CCPA § 1798.105, you have the right to permanently erase your data at any time.</p>
